title: "Piezo: a protocol-free gateway for agent-driven engineering solvers with live log telemetry"
authors:
  - family-names: Nissanka
    given-names: Madeesh P.
version: 0.3.1
date-released: 2026-10-12
license: MIT
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23274734
type: software
abstract: "Piezo is a zero-dependency HTTP gateway that lets AI agents execute CLI engineering solvers with live log telemetry. It provides a declarative adapter system, job management with priority queues, streaming log parsing, and multiple telemetry transports for real-time monitoring."